# Cursor integrated browser only

When opening websites, dashboards (Render, GitHub, app URLs), verifying deploys, or doing any browser automation:

- Use **only** the Cursor integrated browser / IDE browser MCP (`cursor-ide-browser`).
- **Never** launch or rely on an external browser (Chrome/Edge/Firefox outside Cursor, `start https://…`, Playwright against a user desktop browser, etc.).
- Prefer `browser_navigate` → `browser_lock` → interactions → unlock when finished.
- If the integrated browser MCP is unavailable, stop and tell the user — do not fall back to an external browser.
